    "body": "# Bug Report\n\n## Description\n\nIn 1.21.17, [static/drf-yasg/redoc-old/redoc.min.js](https://github.com/axnsan12/drf-yasg/blob/f1b78f7096afec75b2c3b41ad4bbb435b56516e3/src/drf_yasg/static/drf-yasg/redoc-old/redoc.min.js#L8) ends with `//# sourceMappingURL=redoc.min.map`, but the package ships `redoc-old/redoc.min.js.map`. collectstatic with `ManifestStaticFilesStorage /` whitenoise’s `CompressedManifestStaticFilesStorage` fails:\n\n`MissingFileError: The file 'drf-yasg/redoc-old/redoc.min.map' could not be found.`\n\n1.21.15 has the correct sourceMappingURL=redoc.min.js.map, the fix from [axnsan12/drf-yasg#860](https://github.com/axnsan12/drf-yasg/pull/860). It looks like the rebuild in #975 (f1b78f7096) regenerated the file and reverted that fix. Master is still affected.\n\n## Is this a regression?\n\n<!-- Did this behavior use to work in the previous version? -->\n<!-- edit: --> Yes, it is regression of axnsan12/drf-yasg#855\n\n",
