    "body": "The Redoc version in `/src/drf_yasg/static/drf-yasg/redoc/redoc.min.js` is 2.0.0 (last updated in 78031f0c189585c30fccb5005a6899f2d34289a9).\n\nHowever the version in [package-lock.json](https://github.com/axnsan12/drf-yasg/blob/master/package-lock.json#L2801) is 2.5.2.\n\nIt appears the redoc lockfile version was accidentally bumped in https://github.com/axnsan12/drf-yasg/commit/a0559fcacd996b76fbbb5ea0d70aa5c314f06e0c without updating the static files.\n\nI have raised #973 to remedy this.\n",
